or.jpg\" /></span><strong>MISSION EDITOR</strong> - Design your own missions by the intuitive, easy-to-use mission editor and become part of one of the biggest and most creative PC gaming community ever.<br><br><br></li><li><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/33900/extras/CheatProtection.jpg\" /></span><strong>CHEAT PROTECTION</strong> - Optional anti-cheat BattlEye available to help secure dedicated servers. In addition BE adds 'RCON' (remote control) for game's dedicated server software.<br></li></ul>","developers":["Bohemia Interactive"],"dlc":[33934],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/33900/header.jpg?t=1754679005","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright (c) 2009 Bohemia Interactive. All rights reserved. ARMA 2TM and Bohemia InteractiveTM are trademarks of Bohemia Interactive. This product contains software technology licensed from GameSpy Industries, Inc. (c) 1999-2009 GameSpy Industries, Inc. GameSpy and the \"Powered by GameSpy\" design are trademarks of GameSpy Industries, Inc. All rights reserved.<br />\r\n*Operation FlashpointTM is registered trademark of Codemasters Software Company Ltd. ARMA 2 is developed and sold by Bohemia Interactive a.s., which is not affiliated with, authorized by or related to the Codemasters Software Company Ltd.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"metacritic":{"score":77,"url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/pc/arma-ii?ftag=MCD-06-10aaa1f"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/33900/2011/e1872d4397adb6c42a493247c557cf35ce995dde/1751526433/dash_av1.mpd?t=1447351857","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/33900/2011/e1872d4397adb6c42a493247c557cf35ce995dde/1751526433/dash_h264.mpd?t=1447351857","highlight":false,"hls_h264":"